abstract: >-
  Computational materials accompanying the manuscript of the same title.
  The archive includes fixed-wing reference-governor data, frozen source and
  inputs, saved-output reconstruction checks, and an isolated MATLAB entry
  for the representative C1 Direct case. Verification covers selected saved
  summaries and one MATLAB reintegration, rather than an end-to-end rerun of
  every study or interval proof.
keywords:
  - fixed-wing UAV
  - reference governor
  - control barrier function
  - coupled lift-thrust inversion
  - feedback margins
  - computational reproducibility
